uld be recorded in session-smart's doc as a deliberate trade, so nobody later \"fixes\" it by adding a skill the agent can no longer load."},{"n":5,"kind":"note","text":"With a real 60dvh height, the sheet no longer shrinks to fit short content. `ext/drawer/doc/rail-notes.md` c35 still says \"the sheet grows with its content, up to half the screen\", so it is now stale. The comment at rail.js:247 replaced its pointer, but the doc entry needs a line too."},{"n":6,"kind":"note","text":"The Inbox.js fix (lines 51-54) costs one extra `files.jsonl` fetch of the parent folder on each open where the page is not already live. If a page writes `page.jsonl` before its parent's file list is refreshed, its notes are skipped. That is acceptable for removing a console 404, but worth one line in the Inbox doc."},{"n":7,"kind":"note","text":"Ask 6 is not all done: no `check_page` results at 400/1200/1920/3440, no card, and no landing line appear in the diff, and the 400 before/after shots are not committed (next.md says so). Whoever lands this still has to do those steps."}],"branch":"worktree/dictate-next-4","head":"0fd675ef84ccad8703ac05a8053a35b82c2e2e2d","model":"claude-opus-5-5","cost":0.7248124000000001,"file":"review.md","report":null,"shots":null}}
